    can banish that opponent''s monster. If this Synchro Summoned card in its owner''s
    control is destroyed by an opponent''s card: You can destroy all Spells and Traps
    your opponent controls. You can only use each effect of "Dragunity Knight - Areadbhair"
    once per turn.'
